*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                               
*  PROGRAM    :  W5129900                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNcTION   :  READS W51298 KITS PART - PARTS IN KIT FILE AND        *        
*                COMPARES WITH VCCS SALES FILE W51295B AND             *        
*                CREATES KITS SALES FILE                               *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  SARASWATHY S                                          *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W51299D1                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W51298  'IN1-'                                                                 
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W51299D2                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W51295  'IN2-'                                                                 
                                                                                
FILE TPFILE1  FB(16 0)                                                          
%W51295  'T1-'                                                                  
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE TPFILE2  FB(10 0)                                                          
%W51299  'T2-'                                                                  
*                                                                               
FILE W51299D3 FB(10 0)                                                          
*                                                                               
%W51299  'UT-'                                                                  
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
* STEP 1. SORTS W51295B FILE ON PARTNO                                          
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
SORT W51299D2 TO TPFILE1  USING (IN2-IDARTNR) SIZE 900000                       
*                                                                               
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
* STEp 2. COMPARES W51298 AND W51295B                                           
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
JOB INPUT (TPFILE1 KEY (T1-IDARTNR) W51299D1 KEY (IN1-SATS-IDARTNR))            
                                                                                
IF MATCHED                                                                      
  T2-IDARTNR  = IN1-SRAD-IDARTNR                                                
  T2-SULEVANT = IN1-SRAD-REANTPSA * T1-SULEVANT                                 
  IF T2-SULEVANT NE 0                                                           
    PUT TPFILE2                                                                 
  END-IF                                                                        
END-IF                                                                          
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
* STEP 3. SORTS TPFILE2 FILE ON PARTNO                                          
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
SORT TPFILE2 TO W51299D3 USING (T2-IDARTNR) SIZE 900000                         
*                                                                               
